eak their limits and discover a hyper-powerful 4th form! With brand new designs and souped-up stats, you\u2019ll be able to tackle the greatest of challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2125540/extras/4fc989efe3957fa28b18aa7ae6e8064c.avif?t=1761941624\" width=616 height=79 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2125540/extras/efe7481ba954fc43ffcee6a6764dde93.poster.avif?t=1761941624\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2125540/extras/efe7481ba954fc43ffcee6a6764dde93.webm?t=1761941624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2125540/extras/efe7481ba954fc43ffcee6a6764dde93.mp4?t=1761941624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle your team against elite enemies and bosses. Get your team ready to fight against MEGA opponents, and unlock brand new K\u0101domon if you win! Remember, there is always a greater foe to test your strength!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2125540/extras/481d525bcebf221dba5d91b63bce8288.avif?t=1761941624\" width=616 height=79 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2125540/extras/9743ee59e0c236224b7de6184e366853.poster.avif?t=1761941624\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2125540/extras/9743ee59e0c236224b7de6184e366853.webm?t=1761941624\" type=\"video